1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,633
This dad threw his daughter's old teddy bear in the trash while she was at school.

2
00:00:03,773 --> 00:00:05,631
She came home and searched every room.

3
00:00:05,771 --> 00:00:07,350
Dad, have you seen Mister Button?

4
00:00:07,490 --> 00:00:10,044
You're too old for toys, he said, without looking up.

5
00:00:10,184 --> 00:00:12,494
That night, she hugged an empty pillow and cried.

6
00:00:12,634 --> 00:00:14,283
Ten years later, she moved out.

7
00:00:14,423 --> 00:00:16,454
In her closet, he found a small box.

8
00:00:16,594 --> 00:00:17,674
Inside was a note.

9
00:00:17,814 --> 00:00:20,485
Mister Button kept me company every night you worked late.

10
00:00:20,625 --> 00:00:22,713
He sat on her bed and finally understood.

